    "detailed_description": "In this prologue to the game you fill the shoes of a fresh recruit of the Mercenaries. Get your footing in the land of Wyvia and begin to unravel the mystery of the where the Wyverns have gone. Your mission is simple, find the wyverns, uncover the source of the invasion, and discover your role in saving Wyvia.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 open world areas<br></li><li>11 locations<br></li><li>4 classes<br></li><li>2 bosses<br></li><li>12 enemies<br></li><li>21 accessories</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/349398b7b9f36e5ebf45e9f36b7c268f.avif?t=1726259950\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/641ceb807a592f89e9900ce89c87dbc7.poster.avif?t=1726259950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/641ceb807a592f89e9900ce89c87dbc7.webm?t=1726259950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/641ceb807a592f89e9900ce89c87dbc7.mp4?t=1726259950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wyvia features fun and simple combat that feels good to utilize! Whack Goopies with a huge axe or fire away with screen clearing abilities!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/05a8a6bcf970b568f9fe5a1842ea3684.avif?t=1726259950\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380780/extras/fdd2bce3963f89e24fdad7eeaf205644.poster.avif?t=1726259950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.